	// about them — batch them to `POST /references/resolve` for cards. No
	// upstream is dialled, which is what lets the `ETag` mean what it says.
	// What links *here* is `GET /notes/{ref}/backlinks`, a sibling rather
	// than a field, for the same reason: it changes when other notes do.
	//
