// GetTriageReport What triage left behind — the backlog by age, and the decisions that did not finish landing.
//
// Owner only, because it spans every author's corpus.
//
// The four link states are the point. A decision writes tier 2 and then
// reaches Switchyard, and every gap between those two is a state a person
// has to be able to see: `in_flight` is still going, `unresolved` never
// arrived, `ambiguous` found more than one candidate, and `refused` was
// answered no. None of them is a fault the service can fix on its own,
