	// against, so a proposal that has been regenerated since the client read
	// it is refused rather than confirmed against text nobody saw.
	//
	// There is no batch-wide status and there must not be: the interesting
	// case is item 7 of 12 failing, and a single status could not say which
	// one to re-show.
	//
